WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:03.870
Kule vidiyo ndifuna ukwenza iingqokelela yemizekelo yokufektorayiza (ukufumana iifekta zenani elithile).

00:03.870 --> 00:06.590
Inqanaba lesibini lepolinomiyali kudla

00:06.590 --> 00:08.870
ngokuthiwa yikhwadrathiki (quadratic)

00:08.870 --> 00:12.650
Ngamanye amaxesha kuthiwa yipolinomiyali yekhwadrathiki okanye

00:12.650 --> 00:15.850
yikhwadrathiki kuphela, okanye yinkcazelo yekhwadrathiki (quadratic expression) kodwa konke konke kuthiwa

00:15.850 --> 00:18.300
linqanaba lesibini lepolinomiyali.

00:18.300 --> 00:22.440
Kulapho inani elitshintsha-tshintshayo [variable] lingaphakanyiswa libe

00:22.440 --> 00:23.080
kwinqanaba lesibini.

00:23.080 --> 00:26.460
Kule meko, kuyo yonke lemizekelo sizakuyenza le nto (okanye eli nani litshintsha-tshintshayo) liza kuba ngu-x

00:26.460 --> 00:30.740
Masithi sinenkcazelo yekhwadrathiki engu-x

00:30.740 --> 00:35.280
idityaniswe idityaniswe nenani eliguqu-guqukayo [x] eliphinda-phindwe kalishumi laze laphindwa no-9.

00:35.280 --> 00:39.870
Ndifuna ukuyifektirayiza kwimveliso yeebayinomiyalsi ezimbini (Umz. x - y).

00:39.870 --> 00:41.520
Sikwenza njani oko?

00:41.520 --> 00:44.440
Masicinge ukuba kungenzeka na ntoni ukuba singa

00:44.440 --> 00:51.690
thatha u-x odityaniswe no-a, ukuphindaphinde oko no-x odityaniswe no-b.

00:51.690 --> 00:55.050
Ukuba singaphindaphinda ezi zinto (okanye ezi nkcazelo)zimbini, kwenzeka ntoni?

00:55.050 --> 00:57.090
Noko, sinalo ulwazana lokwenza oku.

00:57.090 --> 01:03.170
Oku kuza kuba ngu-x ophindaphindwe no-x, ongu-x okwinqanaba lesibini, umdibanise no-x ophindaphindwe no-b,

01:03.170 --> 01:12.690
oba ngu-bx, umdibanise no-a ophindaphindwe no-x, umdibanise no-a ophindaphindwe no-b, uphinde umdibanise no-ab.

01:12.690 --> 01:15.800
Okanye ukuba sifuna ukudibanisa ezi zimbini ziphakathi ngasekunene apha,

01:15.800 --> 01:18.890
kuba zombini ngamanani andisa u-x (okanye zi-coefficients zika-x).

01:18.890 --> 01:22.102
Singakubhala oku njengo-x ophindaphindiweyo -- Ndingakubhala oku

01:22.102 --> 01:29.700
njengo-b odityaniswe no-a, okanye u-a odityaniswe no-b, x, umdibanise no-ab.

01:29.700 --> 01:34.390
Ngokubanzi, ukuba sicinga oku kuyimveliso

01:34.390 --> 01:40.765
yeebayinomiyals ezimbini, siyabona ukuba ico-efficient (eli nani liphakathi elandisa u-x)

01:40.765 --> 01:43.250
ka-x, okanye ungathi ico-efficient ekwinqanaba lokuqala

01:43.250 --> 01:49.040
phaya, iza kuba sisibalo sika-a no-b.

01:49.040 --> 01:51.360
Ngoko inkcazelo yenani elingatshintshiyo lizakuba yimveliso

01:51.360 --> 01:52.520
ka-a no-b wethu.

01:52.520 --> 01:57.290
Qaphela, oku kungaboniswa ngolu hlobo
